 <h3><u>Chand jaise chehre wale</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haaye...<br> Ali akbar..ali akbar<br> Ali... Ali akbar</p> 
  <p>Koofe ke bazaar me ek zaifa ki padi nazar<br> naize pe akbar ka sar<br> dekhke karne lagi kalaam<br> ayyohal badrut-tamam<br> aye kaash...aye kaash<br> kaash tujhse pehle margai ho teri maa<br> aye naujawaaa..<br> haan.. ali ali akbar ali ali<br> shabihe payambar ali ali</p> 
  <p>1. Haaye,<br> Dekhke akbar ko pukari wo zaifa<br> gesu tere wallail hai wal fajr hai chehra<br> wan-najm hai aankhein..ali akbar ali akbar<br> karti hu duaen..ali akbar ali akbar<br> chand jaise chehre wali, ae hasee jawaa<br> kaash tujhse pehle margai ho teri maa</p> 
  <p>2. Haaye,<br> mai&nbsp; bhi to ek maa hu yaqee hai mujhe itna<br> ke tera qatil koi insaa nahi hoga<br> sar dekhke tera..ali akbar ali akbar<br> dil rota hai mera..ali akbar ali akbar</p> 
  <p>3.&nbsp; Haaye, aisa jaha me kabhi hota bhi nahi hai<br> tera mera khoon ka rishta bhi nahi hai<br> tu kaun hai mera..ali akbar ali akbar<br> kyu karti hu nauha..ali akbar ali akbar</p> 
  <p>4. Haaye, naize tale baithke ye bibiya saari<br> tere liye karti hai sab girya o zaari<br> masroofe aza hai..ali akbar ali akbar<br> sab mehwe buka hai..ali akbar ali akbar</p> 
  <p>5. Haaye, rooh meri kaanp gayi soch ke akbar<br> kaise juda tan se kiya hoga tera sar<br> bedard hai duniya..ali akbar ali akbar<br> mai kehti hu itna..ali akbar ali akbar</p> 
  <p>6. Haaye, sukhi rage teri sunati hai kahani<br> tujhko pilaya nahi do bund bhi pani<br> tu kitna tha pyasa..ali akbar ali akbar<br> kisne tujhe maara..ali akbar ali akbar</p> 
  <p>7. Haaye, kya yaha maujood koi hai teri behna<br> du use seene se lagakar tera pursa<br> marjae na muztar..ali akbar ali akbar<br> nauha mera sunkar..ali akbar ali akbar</p> 
  <p>8. Haaye, maine kisi bibi se ye baat suni hai<br> jisne tujhe paala hai wo teri phuphi hai<br> kya sabr hai uska..ali akbar ali akbar<br> dil phatta hai mera..ali akbar ali akbar</p> 
  <p>9. Haaye, mazhar o ifran qayamat ka tha manzar<br> aagayi sadaat ke halqe me wo muztar<br> karte hue nauha..ali akbar ali akbar<br> arey kohraam bapa tha..haye ali ali akbar ali ali<br> shabihe payambar ali ali..(3)</p> 
